<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Translator Hire</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    
    <div class="container my-5">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-8 mx-auto text-center">
                <h1 class="display-4 mb-4">About Translator Hire</h1>
                <p class="lead">Connecting Businesses with Professional Translators Worldwide</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mt-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h2 class="mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
                <p>At Translator Hire, we're dedicated to breaking down language barriers and facilitating global communication. Our platform connects businesses with skilled translators, making it easier than ever to find the perfect language professional for your needs.</p>
                <p>Whether you need document translation, interpretation services, or localization expertise, we've got you covered with our network of qualified professionals.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h2 class="mb-4">Why Choose Us?</h2>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-danger me-2"></i>Verified Professional Translators</li>
                    <li class="mb-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-danger me-2"></i>Secure Payment System</li>
                    <li class="mb-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-danger me-2"></i>24/7 Customer Support</li>
                    <li class="mb-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-danger me-2"></i>Quality Assurance Process</li>
                    <li class="mb-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-danger me-2"></i>Competitive Pricing</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mt-5">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body text-center">
                        <i class="fas fa-globe fa-3x text-danger mb-3"></i>
                        <h3 class="card-title">Global Reach</h3>
                        <p class="card-text">Connect with translators from around the world, covering over 100 languages and dialects.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body text-center">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt fa-3x text-danger mb-3"></i>
                        <h3 class="card-title">Secure Platform</h3>
                        <p class="card-text">Your data and transactions are protected with industry-standard security measures.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body text-center">
                        <i class="fas fa-handshake fa-3x text-danger mb-3"></i>
                        <h3 class="card-title">Trusted Network</h3>
                        <p class="card-text">Work with verified professionals who have been carefully vetted for their expertise.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html> 